    "# 0 - Table of Symbols"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "40f2034a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "- $G = (V,E)$: a simple graph defined based on its nodes and edges\n",
    "- $V = \\{v\\}$: set of nodes;\n",
    "- $E = \\{(v_i,v_j)\\}$: set of unweighted edges;\n",
    "- $\\mathbf{A} = [a_{i,j}] \\in \\{0;1\\}^{|V| \\times |V|}$: binary adjacency matrix where $a_{i,j} = 1$ denotes the existence of the edge $(v_i,v_j)$;\n",
    "- $\\mathcal{C} = \\langle \\mathcal{T}, \\mathbb{S}, \\vec{s}_0, \\Phi \\rangle$: automaton defined on a tesselation $\\mathcal{T}$, a set of discrete states $\\mathbb{S}$, an initial configuration $\\vec{s}_0$ and a transition function $\\Phi$;\n",
    "- $\\vec{s}_t = [s_{i,t}] \\in \\mathbb{S}^{|V|}$: state vector of $i$-th nodes at time step $t$;\n",
    "- $\\vec{s}^*_t = \\vec{s}_t \\oplus \\delta\\vec{s}$: distubed state vector at time step $t$ by the module-$|\\mathbb{S}|$ addition with a perturbation vector;\n",
    "- $\\mathbf{H} = [\\vec{s}_t] \\in \\mathbb{S}^{|V| \\times T}$ state matrix of nodes evolved by $T$ steps (i.e. time evolution patterns);"
   ]
  },
  {
